OL,3,AFarage unveils small boats deal with
OL,4,AFrench National Rally party
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was signed at Reform's annual
OL,7,Fconference in Birmingham by RN
OL,8,FPresident Jordan Bardella, whom party
OL,9,Fleader and presidential candidate
OL,10,FMarine Le Pen wants to make prime
OL,11,Fminister if she wins office.
